{"id":100305,"slug":"100305-wcag-1-3-1-info-and-relationships-noi-gi-bang-du-lieu-va-nhom-radio-phai-markup","category":"HTML","subcategory":"WCAG","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"WCAG 1.3.1 Info and Relationships nói gì? Bảng dữ liệu và nhóm radio phải markup thế nào cho đạt?","question_en":"What does WCAG 1.3.1 Info and Relationships require? How should data tables and radio groups be marked up?","answer_vi":"1.3.1 (mức A) yêu cầu: **quan hệ giữa các phần nội dung mà mắt nhìn ra được thì máy cũng phải đọc ra được**. Mắt thấy \"cột này là tiêu đề của hàng dưới\", \"bốn ô radio này thuộc chung một câu hỏi\" — screen reader chỉ biết điều đó nếu markup nói ra.\n\nĐây là tiêu chí bị trượt nhiều nhất trong các đợt audit, vì nó bao trùm cả heading, danh sách, bảng, form và landmark.\n\n**Bảng dữ liệu** — dùng `<th>` kèm `scope`, và `<caption>` làm tên bảng:\n\n```html\n<table>\n  <caption>Doanh thu theo quý</caption>\n  <thead>\n    <tr><th scope=\"col\">Quý</th><th scope=\"col\">Doanh thu</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><th scope=\"row\">Q1</th><td>1.2 tỷ</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n```\n\nKhông có `scope`, screen reader đọc từng ô rời rạc \"1.2 tỷ\" mà không kèm \"Q1, Doanh thu\" — người dùng mất hoàn toàn ngữ cảnh. Bảng nhiều tầng tiêu đề thì dùng `headers`/`id`.\n\n**Nhóm radio hoặc checkbox** — bọc bằng `<fieldset>` và đặt câu hỏi vào `<legend>`:\n\n```html\n<fieldset>\n  <legend>Hình thức thanh toán</legend>\n  <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"pay\" value=\"cod\"> Khi nhận hàng</label>\n  <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"pay\" value=\"bank\"> Chuyển khoản</label>\n</fieldset>\n```\n\nMỗi input đã có label riêng, nhưng thiếu `legend` thì screen reader đọc \"Chuyển khoản, nút radio\" mà không biết đang chọn cho câu hỏi nào.\n\n**Lưu ý:** dùng `<table>` để dàn layout, hoặc dựng bảng bằng `<div>` có `display: grid` — cả hai đều xoá sạch quan hệ hàng-cột trong accessibility tree","answer_en":"1.3.1 (level A) requires that **relationships visible on screen must also be available programmatically**. The eye sees \"this column heads the rows below\", \"these four radios answer one question\" — a screen reader knows that only if the markup says so.\n\nIt is the most-failed criterion in audits, because it spans headings, lists, tables, forms and landmarks.\n\n**Data tables** — use `<th>` with `scope`, and `<caption>` as the table name:\n\n```html\n<table>\n  <caption>Revenue by quarter</caption>\n  <thead>\n    <tr><th scope=\"col\">Quarter</th><th scope=\"col\">Revenue</th></tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><th scope=\"row\">Q1</th><td>1.2B</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n```\n\nWithout `scope`, the screen reader announces a bare \"1.2B\" with no \"Q1, Revenue\" attached, and the user loses all context. Multi-level headers need `headers`/`id`.\n\n**Radio or checkbox groups** — wrap them in `<fieldset>` and put the question in `<legend>`:\n\n```html\n<fieldset>\n  <legend>Payment method</legend>\n  <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"pay\" value=\"cod\"> Cash on delivery</label>\n  <label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"pay\" value=\"bank\"> Bank transfer</label>\n</fieldset>\n```\n\nEach input already has its own label, but without the `legend` the screen reader says \"Bank transfer, radio button\" with no hint of which question is being answered.\n\n**Note:** using `<table>` for layout, or rebuilding a table out of `<div>`s with `display: grid` — both wipe the row/column relationships out of the accessibility tree","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">1.3.1 (mức A) yêu cầu: <strong>quan hệ giữa các phần nội dung mà mắt nhìn ra được thì máy cũng phải đọc ra được</strong>. Mắt thấy \"cột này là tiêu đề của hàng dưới\", \"bốn ô radio này thuộc chung một câu hỏi\" — screen reader chỉ biết điều đó nếu markup nói ra.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Đây là tiêu chí bị trượt nhiều nhất trong các đợt audit, vì nó bao trùm cả heading, danh sách, bảng, form và landmark.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Bảng dữ liệu</strong> — dùng <code>&lt;th&gt;</code> kèm <code>scope</code>, và <code>&lt;caption&gt;</code> làm tên bảng:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;table&gt;\n  &lt;caption&gt;Doanh thu theo quý&lt;/caption&gt;\n  &lt;thead&gt;\n    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Quý&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Doanh thu&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n  &lt;/thead&gt;\n  &lt;tbody&gt;\n    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;row&quot;&gt;Q1&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;1.2 tỷ&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n  &lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">table</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">caption</span>&gt;</span>Doanh thu theo quý<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">caption</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">thead</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;col&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Quý<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;col&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Doanh thu<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">thead</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tbody</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;row&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Q1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>&gt;</span>1.2 tỷ<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tbody</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">table</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Không có <code>scope</code>, screen reader đọc từng ô rời rạc \"1.2 tỷ\" mà không kèm \"Q1, Doanh thu\" — người dùng mất hoàn toàn ngữ cảnh. Bảng nhiều tầng tiêu đề thì dùng <code>headers</code>/<code>id</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Nhóm radio hoặc checkbox</strong> — bọc bằng <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> và đặt câu hỏi vào <code>&lt;legend&gt;</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;fieldset&gt;\n  &lt;legend&gt;Hình thức thanh toán&lt;/legend&gt;\n  &lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;pay&quot; value=&quot;cod&quot;&gt; Khi nhận hàng&lt;/label&gt;\n  &lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;pay&quot; value=&quot;bank&quot;&gt; Chuyển khoản&lt;/label&gt;\n&lt;/fieldset&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>Hình thức thanh toán<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pay&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cod&quot;</span>&gt;</span> Khi nhận hàng<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pay&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;bank&quot;</span>&gt;</span> Chuyển khoản<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Mỗi input đã có label riêng, nhưng thiếu <code>legend</code> thì screen reader đọc \"Chuyển khoản, nút radio\" mà không biết đang chọn cho câu hỏi nào.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> dùng <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> để dàn layout, hoặc dựng bảng bằng <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> có <code>display: grid</code> — cả hai đều xoá sạch quan hệ hàng-cột trong accessibility tree.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">1.3.1 (level A) requires that <strong>relationships visible on screen must also be available programmatically</strong>. The eye sees \"this column heads the rows below\", \"these four radios answer one question\" — a screen reader knows that only if the markup says so.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">It is the most-failed criterion in audits, because it spans headings, lists, tables, forms and landmarks.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Data tables</strong> — use <code>&lt;th&gt;</code> with <code>scope</code>, and <code>&lt;caption&gt;</code> as the table name:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;table&gt;\n  &lt;caption&gt;Revenue by quarter&lt;/caption&gt;\n  &lt;thead&gt;\n    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Quarter&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot;&gt;Revenue&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n  &lt;/thead&gt;\n  &lt;tbody&gt;\n    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;th scope=&quot;row&quot;&gt;Q1&lt;/th&gt;&lt;td&gt;1.2B&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;\n  &lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">table</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">caption</span>&gt;</span>Revenue by quarter<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">caption</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">thead</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;col&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Quarter<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;col&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Revenue<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">thead</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tbody</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">scope</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;row&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Q1<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">th</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>&gt;</span>1.2B<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">td</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tr</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">tbody</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">table</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Without <code>scope</code>, the screen reader announces a bare \"1.2B\" with no \"Q1, Revenue\" attached, and the user loses all context. Multi-level headers need <code>headers</code>/<code>id</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Radio or checkbox groups</strong> — wrap them in <code>&lt;fieldset&gt;</code> and put the question in <code>&lt;legend&gt;</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;fieldset&gt;\n  &lt;legend&gt;Payment method&lt;/legend&gt;\n  &lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;pay&quot; value=&quot;cod&quot;&gt; Cash on delivery&lt;/label&gt;\n  &lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;radio&quot; name=&quot;pay&quot; value=&quot;bank&quot;&gt; Bank transfer&lt;/label&gt;\n&lt;/fieldset&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>Payment method<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">legend</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pay&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cod&quot;</span>&gt;</span> Cash on delivery<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;radio&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pay&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;bank&quot;</span>&gt;</span> Bank transfer<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">fieldset</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Each input already has its own label, but without the <code>legend</code> the screen reader says \"Bank transfer, radio button\" with no hint of which question is being answered.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> using <code>&lt;table&gt;</code> for layout, or rebuilding a table out of <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>s with <code>display: grid</code> — both wipe the row/column relationships out of the accessibility tree.</p>","references":[{"label":"WCAG 2.2 — Understanding 1.3.1 Info and Relationships","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/info-and-relationships.html"},{"label":"W3C WAI — Tables tutorial","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/tables/"},{"label":"WebAIM — Creating accessible tables","url":"https://webaim.org/techniques/tables/data"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/3-the-doctype-la-gi-tai-sao-can-khai-bao-doctype","title":"Thẻ DOCTYPE là gì? Tại sao cần khai báo DOCTYPE?"},{"url":"/q/4-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-mot-tai-lieu-html-bao-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Cấu trúc cơ bản của một tài liệu HTML bao gồm những gì?"},{"url":"/q/8-block-level-element-va-inline-element-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao-trong-html","title":"Block-level element và Inline element khác nhau như thế nào trong HTML?"},{"url":"/q/12-html-attribute-thuoc-tinh-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"HTML Attribute (thuộc tính) là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/13-boolean-attribute-trong-html-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"Boolean attribute trong HTML là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/14-custom-data-attribute-data-trong-html-la-gi","title":"Custom data attribute (data-*) trong HTML là gì?"},{"url":"/q/15-thuoc-tinh-id-va-class-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Thuộc tính `id` và `class` khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"}]}